WEBVTT

00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:32.263
This time in academic research.

00:06:32.304 --> 00:06:34.432
When I began to explore
biological research

00:06:34.473 --> 00:06:36.434
in my second year of college,

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:38.394
I remember trying to find a mentor

00:06:38.394 --> 00:06:43.607
and being discouraged
to only see white male researchers.

00:06:43.607 --> 00:06:47.486
Just like in music,
this trend is systemic.

00:06:47.486 --> 00:06:52.408
Only 15 percent of all doctoral
researchers were Native American,

00:06:52.408 --> 00:06:55.077
African-American or Hispanic.

00:06:55.119 --> 00:06:56.829
I wanted to change that.

00:06:56.871 --> 00:06:58.914
And I knew that
the virtual nonprofit model

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:00.541
that I had already developed